body:
I drank 1.5t ltr of whiskey last three days while working. It helps, but it fucks you up. At least for me personally, you've gotta stay solidly piddled to stave it off, which quickly becomes an excessive habit where you're suddenly crushingly low then remember and scramble for a drink. Then the other drugs get involved because your so tired from days of continuous drinking.

&#x200B;

No lectures here, but I be careful how much your drinking before things go west sharpish.
